Package: com.duoface.carplay.nativescenehost
Name: DuoFace Native Dashboard Scene Host (Development)
Version: 0.1.7~nativecore1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Section: Development
Maintainer: DuoFace Independent
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), mobilesubstrate
Description: First-party experimental iOS16 rootless CarPlay app scene host. Real installed-app picker, source-owned external SBAppViewController host, scene-ready/failure signals, split/swap/focus/drag and strict disconnect/heartbeat teardown. The CarPlay receiver draws no demo panes or fake action buttons; iPhone shows only actual installed-app inventory and active-session status. No external vendor binary or licensing; actual dual-app rendering and touch on iPhone X/CarPlay not yet device-verified. Unreleased candidate.
